{"images":["data:image/webp;base64,"],"messages":[{"content":"Refer to the figure <image>, which term describes reading aloud in unison or parts with a whole class, small group, or individual students so that students hear the text at the same time they read it?\n\n(A) Choral Reading\n(B) Literature Circle\n(C) Readers Theatre\n(D) Shared Reading\n\nAnswer with the option's letter from the given choices directly.","role":"user"}]}